Asiko Energy trades and moves LPG, propane, butane, CNG and LNG. Before Kita, each of its divisions ran on its own spreadsheets. Kita is the internal platform that replaced them.

Operations, the backbone of the business, manages inventory on Kita and has more modules there than any other division. Logistics logs every trip. Sales and marketing, finance and legal have their own modules, and the CEO follows all of it from a dashboard he arranges himself. I’ve been Kita’s only designer since 2024, responsible for its design system and more than a dozen modules.

